  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\n<!-- Describe here the feature you are requesting. -->\r\nIf Matrix is not only bridged to emails but also to SIP (https://github.com/alangecker/matrix-appservice-pstn), we'll soon be able to use only matrix to communicate with everybody.\r\nIn that case, we'll need a tool to manage our contact within matrix client, a kind of address book (first and last name, tel, email, address and matrix ID of course etc....) and matrix clients will need to sync between other matrix client we own on devices and be able to sync with cloud and email app thanks to carddav I guess.\r\n\r\nShould synapse integrate a carddav sync system to help matrix client apps to get/retrieve/manage contacts info.",
